---
<section id="services" class="services-section">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2>Услуги по <span class="gradient-text">AI-интеграции</span></h2>
			<p>Автоматизируем процессы, настраиваем маркетинг и внедряем нейросети под ключ</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="services-grid">
			<!-- Единственная услуга -->
			<div class="glass-card service-card" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="window.location.href='/service'">
				<div class="service-icon purple">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"></circle><line x1="20" y1="8" x2="20" y2="14"></line><line x1="23" y1="11" x2="17" y2="11"></line></svg>
				</div>
				<h3><a href="/service">AI в отдел продаж (CRM)</a></h3>
				<p>Интеграция AI-ассистентов в amoCRM и Битрикс24. Автоматическое заполнение карточек сделок по итогам звонков, генерация саммари переговоров и контроль качества работы менеджеров.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	/* Услуги */
	.services-section {
		padding: 100px 0 60px 0;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13,15,20,0) 0%, rgba(20,24,33,0.3) 50%, rgba(13,15,20,0) 100%);
	}

	html.light .services-section {
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 0%, rgba(230,235,245,0.4) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);
	}

	.section-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto 60px auto;
	}

	.section-header h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.section-header p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.services-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.service-card {
		padding: 24px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 16px;
		transition: border-color var(--transition-normal), transform var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal);
	}

	.service-card:hover {
		transform: none;
		box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
	}

	.service-icon {
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.service-icon.purple {
		background: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2);
		color: var(--accent-purple);
	}

	.service-icon.cyan {
		background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	.service-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}

	.service-card h3 a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color var(--transition-fast);
	}

	.service-card h3 a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	.service-card p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1200px) {
		.services-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.services-section {
			padding: 40px 0;
		}
		
		.section-header {
			margin-bottom: 30px;
		}
		
		.section-header h2 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.services-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 16px;
		}
	}
</style>
